WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:06,220
Old madam, my slave has made a soothing soup. Drink it while it's hot to calm down your mind.

2
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:10,850
Just what Song said

3
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:15,480
What does it mean?

4
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:20,380
When you join the public service, doesn't it all depend on your recommendation?

5
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:23,570
Speaking of which, it was the son's fault.

6
00:00:23,570 --> 00:00:24,770
What's wrong with you?

7
00:00:24,770 --> 00:00:27,490
I learned that Xuzhi's visit to the public office was not for my revenge.

8
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:30,900
There was indeed resentment in the son's heart.

9
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:33,900
Lu Yunzhe happened to come to the door and said he could help his son.

10
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:37,020
The son was obsessed for a moment, so he hardened him.

11
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:40,820
Lu Yunzhe? Is he the prince of the Changxin Hou Mansion?

12
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:42,020
Exactly.

13
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:44,100
Why didn't you tell me about this?

14
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:49,220
The son did not dare to tell his mother about this because he did not want his mother to be estranged from him again because of this incident.
